      16#7A#, 16#93#, 16#55#, 16#D2#, 16#25#, 16#A6#, 16#B8#, 16#70#,
      16#2B#, 16#40#, 16#49#, 16#81#, 16#2C#, 16#E8#, 16#67#, 16#2D#,
      16#75#, 16#B6#, 16#4A#, 16#4E#, 16#EB#, 16#3A#, 16#F7#, 16#CB#,
