      16#C4#, 16#7F#, 16#76#, 16#78#, 16#E4#, 16#BD#, 16#C8#, 16#A7#,
      16#5E#, 16#8D#, 16#17#, 16#D1#, 16#C9#, 16#39#, 16#D2#, 16#70#,
