      16#CD#, 16#32#, 16#D4#, 16#CA#, 16#8B#, 16#72#, 16#DE#, 16#44#,
      16#3A#, 16#97#, 16#AC#, 16#26#, 16#A4#, 16#30#, 16#63#, 16#E6#,
      16#26#, 16#2B#, 16#15#, 16#71#, 16#72#, 16#83#, 16#BD#, 16#E2#,
      16#B6#, 16#73#, 16#33#, 16#86#, 16#F0#, 16#FE#, 16#24#, 16#80#,
